' Issue 2: first isolated runtime test, AFTER a reviewed candidate exists.
' R4/R5 Close are unsafe: do not run this test with those libraries.
' Baseline control: validated M4a. No double buffering or swap here.
' Syntax reviewed against AMOS Pro manual; native parse/run still required.
Cls
Print "STAGE 0 - BEFORE OPEN"
Wait Key
_OK=Aga Screen Open(320,256,256,$00021000)
Amos To Front
Print "STAGE 1 - OPEN = ";_OK
If _OK<>0
   Print "STAGE 2 - BEFORE CLOSE"
   Wait Key
   Aga Screen Close
   Print "STAGE 3 - CLOSE RETURNED"
End If
Print "OPEN CLOSE TEST FINISHED"
Wait Key
End
